{"text": "A fly landed on his shoulder, and he hit it with his trunk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You could not do that with your old nose, said the Python. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he picked some grass with his trunk and ate it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the sun was hot, he put cool mud on his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Elephants Child went home, swinging his new trunk happily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked fruit from the trees instead of waiting for it to fall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also picked up all the melon skins that he had dropped on the way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he got home, he played some funny tricks on his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pulled the Ostrichs tail feathers and blew bubbles into the Hippos ear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon his relatives hurried to the Limpopo to get new noses too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And that is why every elephant today has a long trunk.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "f", "l", "y", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "l", "d", "e", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "i", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "t", "r", "u", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "d", "o", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "s", "e", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "P", "y", "t", "h", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "p", "i", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "s", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "t", "r", "u", "n", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d"